    verification suiteMeasuresTheWorkspaceReviewGate : Test { :>> id = "3a76daea-987a-429d-b25e-32a022811f91"; :>> title = "Sprint 742 review gate — three passes per D0172"; :>> createdAt = "2026-09-18"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "Verifier receipt only: keel gate validate, check-engine, guard --no-receipt, sync-claude --check, the verify ladder with --probe-from naming pair742.txt (D0500), cargo clippy; the recorder writes this gate from the receipt. Three passes per D0172. Correctness: the roots are the manifest's members plus the unowned four and nothing typed (the_deliverable_is_every_member_the_root_manifest_lists_plus_what_no_member_owns, over a synthetic manifest, a manifest with no members and the real one); a member edit moves that member's digest alone and the staleness names it while an edit under target/ or .keel/ moves nothing (a_member_edit_moves_its_own_part_and_the_staleness_names_it, on a temp git repository with a per-process name, issue570); the receipt carries one row per root and round-trips them, and a receipt with no rows says it predates them rather than naming a member it cannot (a_receipt_carries_one_row_per_root_and_round_trips_them). Honesty: the positive's receipt clause is read from the file the detached run wrote, and its digests are held against a recomputation that shares no code with suite.rs; the negative plants real files in the real tree and asserts the digests are byte-equal, removing the plants on every path; the passed count's decomposition (667 + 15 + 273) is read from the run's log, not inferred. Scope: the diff is members/keel-suite/src/suite.rs alone - no path under GUARD_SOURCE_FILES/GUARD_SOURCE_DIRS, no .githooks, CI yml, schema or process file - so no Decision is recorded and none is owed. NOT A PROCESS CHANGE: keel suite gates nothing (D0356) and land does not consult land_refusal; what changes is what the receipt measures and how it says so, authored by issue588's resolver under D0479, which is accepted."; }
